+
+## Requested
+- Retrieve the original Case22 kitchen video from the user's logged-in Xiaohongshu page.
+- Compact chapter 2 without losing the six requested cases: overview, scene pair,
+  hand pair, replay/rollout pair, summary. Keep original fonts and media-first design.
+- Preserve Control and Improvement content, existing media bytes, source credits,
+  scientific boundaries, embedded Chinese narration and fully offline HTML.
+- No paper deep dive in Data; no release, push, or legacy PPTX/PDF/ZIP update.
