+CDP attachment or policy bypass is permitted. The user subsequently supplied the
+author's X post and LinkedIn post. Public X oEmbed/syndication expose the matching
+20.93-second kitchen demo. Its 720p video was downloaded without account access,
+remuxed without audio or extra speedup and decoded fully. LinkedIn confirms
+human-in-the-loop asset modelling, with simulation still being added. This
+resolves the media requirement; the initial source-image fallback is superseded.
+
+## Acceptance
+- 32 slides: Data 17–21, Improvement 22–30, closing 31–32.
+- Six Data cases across three double-video showcase pages; all 19 prior clips
+  remain byte-identical, and the kitchen clip brings the total to 20.
+- Sparse labels, aligned pairs, uncropped media; fullscreen/figure zoom available.
+- Chinese script compresses repeated explanations, preserves source limitations,
+  and transitions directly between the three pairs. Timing is suggested only.
+- Baseline regressions, static verification, full browser/media/mobile checks,
+  rendered visual inspection and separate Standards/Spec review.
